</ul></nav></section><section class="front-matter"><div class="ameta p font-secondary font-xs">
<hgroup><h1>Dynamic neural architecture for social knowledge retrieval</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Wang%20Y"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Yin Wang</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Yin Wang</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>Department of Psychology, Temple University, Philadelphia, PA 19122;</div>
