<div class="p">
<sup>a</sup>Department of Psychology, Temple University, Philadelphia, PA 19122;</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Olson%20IR"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Ingrid R Olson</span></a>
